    description: "Pass 17 finding NNNNNN. edge.type distribution across 108649 edges showing 17 distinct types. Three types appear with count == 1: inherits (1, vs extends 147 — same semantic; s8 VV calls these out), script_src (1, html-specific 'this script tag includes this URL'), overrides (1, method override). The 'inherits' singleton is suspicious because 'extends' (147) covers the same semantic in stricter form. Bundle with classification_axes_audit. Similar pattern as s16 IIIII (evidence_type 5 single-occurrence vestigial values)."  # 9848
    fields:  # 9848
      statement: "When an axis vocabulary contains values with exactly 1 occurrence across a population of 100K+, those values are either vestigial (left over from a removed code path) or evidence of an under-tested edge case. Either way, the vocabulary should be audited."  # 9848
