  message: "Implemented in commit 730a297975 (origin/dev) per the 2026-06-25 human ruling. (1) inherits + overrides KEPT (corpus-artifact, not vestigial — Solidity/BitBake producers under-represented in the Python-heavy dogfood corpus); overrides ADDED to ADR-0023's prose not-deprecate list. (2) script_src MIGRATED: html.py now emits edge_type='references' + meta['construct']='script_src' (new registered construct meta key, replacing the framework_dispatch='html_script_src' misuse — no consumer). script_src stays registered-as-deprecated per the endpoint-shape convention (cf. http_calls/grpc_calls). Behavioral evidence — production-path tests: test_html_analysis.py + BRANCHES_test_html.py now assert the script edge is type='references' with meta['construct']=='script_src' (was edge_type 'script_src'). 100% coverage; full affected suite 10831 passed. Cross-language extends/inherits/implements consistency remains WI-moliz."  # 5b06
